WEBVTT

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:13.542
Stop it...

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:18.958
C'mon, stop!

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:20.792
How cute.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.125
Stop!

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:29.750
Stop it!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.542
Stop!

00:00:32.542 --> 00:00:35.458
Don't!

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.792
Open this door, Reiji!

00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:49.292
Don't you hear me?

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.167
Please help us.

00:00:57.792 --> 00:01:00.458
Evil begone, be purified now!

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:03.667
Chocoran chakaran sowaka!

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:07.083
Evil begone, be purified now!

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:11.792
Chocoran chakaran, unjala sowaka...

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.792
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:01:36.042 --> 00:01:38.917
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:01:38.917 --> 00:01:46.292
<i>Tsukiakari no shita de...</i>

00:01:46.292 --> 00:01:49.000
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:53.833
<i>...yakusoku wo kawashita</i>

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:58.708
<i>Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite</i>

00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:04.125
<i>Chinmoku to zattou no naka</i>

00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:09.333
<i>Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai</i>

00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:13.292
<i>Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite</i>

00:02:13.292 --> 00:02:17.167
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:22.375
<i>Kamereon janakute</i>

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:27.500
<i>Kokoro kara kawarou</i>

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.208
<i>Kikoeru yo sono kotoba</i>

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:37.750
<i>Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:41.458
<i>Hageshisa to yasashisa de</i>

00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:53.000
<i>Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.292
"Victims Still in Comatose State"
Until now, a viral agent has been the suspected culprit

00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:13.250
"Victims Still in Comatose State"
behind a string of incidents

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.583
in which high school students have
been collapsing in comatose states.

00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:18.417
However, we have just received
new information on that story.

00:03:18.417 --> 00:03:22.625
According to reports, all of
the victims of this strange affliction

00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:25.917
are graduates of the same
private middle school in Tokyo.

00:03:25.917 --> 00:03:28.667
Police are now questioning relevant
members of the middle school staff,

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:30.292
and also focusing their investigation

00:03:30.292 --> 00:03:34.250
on interactions the victims
may have had with each other.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.750
"Victim Found Comatose at Home"

00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:38.792
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:38.792 --> 00:03:39.708
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Sixth Night"

00:03:39.917 --> 00:03:41.750
"Living Hell"

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:42.333
"Sakuragaoka Central Hospital"

00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:45.042
"Sakuragaoka Central Hospital"
Is this that "spiritual healing" stuff?

00:03:45.042 --> 00:03:48.458
Yeah, we've seen devils and
magic and tons of crazy stuff,

00:03:48.458 --> 00:03:51.042
so at this point we should be
the last people to doubt her.

00:03:55.917 --> 00:03:58.958
It seems this girl has had
her consciousness imprisoned

00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:00.250
in someone else's mindscape.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.375
Someone with considerable power.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:03.958
Mindscape?

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:05.917
Very strong thoughts.

00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:09.833
They appear to have an
extremely strong hold on the girl.

00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:13.375
Sure doesn't sound like the work
of any ordinary person to me.

00:04:13.375 --> 00:04:16.125
Which means...

00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:18.208
It's someone who has power.

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:21.917
Who the heck would do this?

00:04:21.917 --> 00:04:24.792
In any case, if she remains in this comatose state,

00:04:24.792 --> 00:04:26.875
her body will break down
and she will ultimately die.

00:04:26.875 --> 00:04:28.458
Her life is in danger.

00:04:28.458 --> 00:04:31.292
Well, you can do <i>something</i>, can't you?!

00:04:31.292 --> 00:04:35.583
That's why we came to this
godforsaken hospital to begin with!

00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:37.417
Well, listen to this!

00:04:37.417 --> 00:04:40.333
Seems you've learned to use
that mouth of yours awful well.

00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:42.042
And here I remember the little kid,

00:04:42.042 --> 00:04:44.667
who used to come screaming
and crying to me all the time.

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:47.625
Shut up! Don't go drudgin' up
every little thing from the past!

00:04:47.625 --> 00:04:50.458
Okay, whatever, but more importantly,

00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:54.125
you all want to know
how to save this girl, right?

00:04:54.125 --> 00:04:58.042
Unfortunately, all we can do
here is offer emergency treatment.

00:04:58.042 --> 00:04:59.792
What do you mean?

00:04:59.792 --> 00:05:02.375
The best I can do is to attempt
to stop these other thoughts

00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:04.708
from fully imprisoning her consciousness.

00:05:04.708 --> 00:05:06.333
To save her, your only choice

00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:09.958
is to find whoever is behind this,
and stop them yourselves.

00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:13.583
And you'll want to do that
as quickly as you possibly can.

00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:17.125
What if that person really does have power?

00:05:17.125 --> 00:05:20.167
We could end up having to kill 'em.

00:05:20.167 --> 00:05:22.958
But at this rate, Aoi could...

00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:25.458
Hey, have you gotten a hold of Kisaragi?

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:27.625
I've called him a dozen times!

00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:30.083
Where the heck could he be at a time like this?

00:06:04.542 --> 00:06:05.625
Good boy.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.917
Oh!

00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:16.417
A doggie...

00:06:16.417 --> 00:06:18.333
In front of the hospital just now...

00:06:18.333 --> 00:06:20.042
Huh? A dog?

00:06:20.042 --> 00:06:22.333
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:25.042
Takamizawa's always seeing this and that.

00:06:25.042 --> 00:06:28.042
Do you mean, like, ghosts?

00:06:28.042 --> 00:06:29.000
Yup!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.792
It seems like he's been wanting to see her lately.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.958
"Victim Found Comatose at Home"

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.583
In the city, a baffling string
of spontaneous comas...

00:06:46.583 --> 00:06:49.208
Students of the same private middle school...

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:08.583
"Kagura Junior High Graduate Record"

00:07:08.583 --> 00:07:09.583
Here it is.

00:07:11.792 --> 00:07:16.083
Hello, I'm with the Kagura
Middle School Alumni Association.

00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:18.792
Actually, I'm a graduate of Kagura myself.

00:07:18.792 --> 00:07:21.500
I was hoping to ask you about an old
rumor from our middle school days.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.375
Kyouko!

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:25.417
--Where do you think you're going at this hour?!
--Out for a walk!

00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:30.625
"Kyouko Tohno
Calling"

00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:34.875
Tohno? Aoi's asleep right now.

00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:37.625
We're at the hospital right now.

00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:39.542
Hm? What?

00:07:41.958 --> 00:07:46.000
So, Tohno said to get over
to Tsukimidai on the double?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.583
I don't know the full details,

00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:52.292
but she said it's got something
to do with how Aoi collapsed.

00:07:52.292 --> 00:07:54.333
I want to see for myself what's going on.

00:07:54.333 --> 00:07:55.458
Right on!

00:07:55.458 --> 00:07:58.125
Aoi will be okay as long as
Granny's got an eye on her!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:13.500
We must make sure this holds until
they find out where the spell caster is.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.792
Gotcha!

00:08:19.125 --> 00:08:20.583
This is the guy!

00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:24.208
This is the guy who's to blame
for Aoi going into a coma!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.375
Who's he?

00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:28.792
Reiji Sagaya.

00:08:28.792 --> 00:08:32.125
He's the one behind all these
high school students falling comatose!

00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:34.583
How the heck did you find out?

00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:39.500
"Top Secret" "Go get 'em! The hot guy next door"
I am the soon-to-be journalist phenom...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.333
"Go get 'em! The hot guy next door" "Grandma's secret techniques"
I am the soon-to-be journalist phenom...

00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:42.292
"Grandma's Secret Techniques" "Brilliant excuses for being late"
I am the soon-to-be journalist phenom...

00:08:43.875 --> 00:08:45.750
Kyouko Tohno.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.625
I know all about students in the metro area!

00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:51.750
Their test scores, the number of
times they've been late to class...

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.917
I know everything from what's in your lunch,

00:08:53.917 --> 00:08:57.708
right down to the holes in your socks!

00:08:57.708 --> 00:08:59.625
Seriously?!

00:08:59.625 --> 00:09:01.125
Wow...

00:09:03.958 --> 00:09:05.792
"Kagura Private Junior High School"

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:11.083
All of people who have fallen into
comas are bullies from Kagura Middle,

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:15.333
and the target of their bullying was Reiji Sagaya.

00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:19.167
The rumors make it sound like
they really bullied the heck out of him.

00:09:19.167 --> 00:09:22.458
It's a wonder that none of it ever came to light.

00:10:07.458 --> 00:10:12.833
Sagaya hasn't even set foot
outside his own home since graduation.

00:10:12.833 --> 00:10:15.167
But since this past spring,

00:10:15.167 --> 00:10:17.667
a rumor's been circulating among
the kids who used to bully him

00:10:17.667 --> 00:10:19.708
that he's going to come after
each of them and get even

00:10:19.708 --> 00:10:21.708
in their dreams!

00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:25.833
In the end, even his parents
treated him like some kind of monster.

00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:27.792
This past spring?

00:10:27.792 --> 00:10:29.583
In their dreams, huh?

00:10:29.583 --> 00:10:32.958
If he's another one with inhuman powers,

00:10:32.958 --> 00:10:35.000
what you're saying is entirely possible.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.917
But why Aoi?

00:10:36.917 --> 00:10:40.292
Why should Aoi have to go through that too?

00:10:40.292 --> 00:10:42.000
I don't know...

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:45.125
But Misato went to Kagura Middle School too!

00:10:45.125 --> 00:10:47.667
There's definitely some connection.

00:10:47.667 --> 00:10:49.458
Okay, then we're gonna find out where he lives!

00:10:49.458 --> 00:10:51.500
--<i>One </i>moment please!
--Huh?

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.250
Why do you think I've called you all here?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.625
This is where he lives!

00:10:57.625 --> 00:10:59.792
Unit #504.

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:01.042
Thank you.

00:11:01.042 --> 00:11:02.625
Okay, let's do it!

00:11:07.375 --> 00:11:09.458
Tohno...

00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:11.458
I'm sorry.

00:11:11.458 --> 00:11:14.167
I thought you...

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.917
No need to say it, I know!

00:11:17.917 --> 00:11:22.125
Even if it would be the scoop of the century,
I will keep your true identities secret,

00:11:22.125 --> 00:11:23.292
so don't you worry!

00:11:23.292 --> 00:11:24.292
Huh?

00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:29.000
A secret group of justice fighters
battling the forces of evil, now that's hot!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.458
You think I'd let anyone else in on that?

00:11:31.458 --> 00:11:35.708
From now on, I'm going to
specialize in covering your story!

00:11:35.708 --> 00:11:38.083
It's all right!
No one's going to find you out!

00:11:38.083 --> 00:11:41.500
But in return, I've got exclusive
rights to the story, okay?

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:47.750
See, I remember how you
all saved me back then.

00:11:49.917 --> 00:11:53.125
When Misato comes to, tell her I'm sorry, okay?

00:11:53.125 --> 00:11:59.292
It's not that I was afraid of you all.
I was just a little surprised, that's all.

00:11:59.292 --> 00:12:01.542
Tell her I said sorry.

00:12:01.542 --> 00:12:04.042
If that's how you feel,
why not tell her yourself?

00:12:04.042 --> 00:12:07.708
We're going to protect Aoi no matter what!

00:12:08.958 --> 00:12:11.958
Well, keep an eye on her while we're gone, okay?

00:12:14.708 --> 00:12:15.958
Leave it to me!

00:12:20.958 --> 00:12:23.375
There was no reason.

00:12:23.375 --> 00:12:27.958
They simply enjoyed bullying me.

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:30.625
I was a toy to them.

00:12:34.125 --> 00:12:38.125
But then you appeared one day.

00:12:53.417 --> 00:12:55.417
Stop...

00:12:55.417 --> 00:12:59.833
I hear you and Aoi Misato from
Class A have been feeding this dog.

00:12:59.833 --> 00:13:02.250
Who do you think you are going
around getting close to girls?

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.667
Stop this...

00:13:04.667 --> 00:13:08.167
No, don't!

00:13:09.792 --> 00:13:11.958
It's been three years since then.

00:13:11.958 --> 00:13:15.792
But not a day went by
when I didn't think of them.

00:13:15.792 --> 00:13:19.250
And then one day, I got my chance.

00:13:23.625 --> 00:13:26.833
You're the only one who's different.

00:13:26.833 --> 00:13:30.750
You, I will protect.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.417
Let's stay here together in this world.

00:13:47.875 --> 00:13:53.542
Aoi, why won't you open your eyes?

00:13:57.125 --> 00:14:03.458
I get it. There's someone
holding you to the world, isn't there?

00:14:05.667 --> 00:14:08.000
Let's go, Tiny.

00:14:14.125 --> 00:14:16.458
Oh, what a bother.

00:14:18.333 --> 00:14:20.792
It was just getting good.

00:14:34.542 --> 00:14:37.125
As I thought, all the seals have been broken.

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:49.125
You are Kisaragi's son, are you?

00:14:51.292 --> 00:14:53.917
Oinshichiri kyararo hauunken sowaka.

00:14:54.708 --> 00:14:59.125
--Misato, hang in there!
--Oinshichiri kyararo hauunken sowaka.

00:15:06.125 --> 00:15:10.042
Breaking that barrier and
getting in here is no mean feat.

00:15:10.042 --> 00:15:13.208
The doggie from earlier looks different now.

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:22.125
I won't have mercy on
anyone who takes Aoi from me.

00:15:22.125 --> 00:15:23.958
A vengeful spirit?

00:15:23.958 --> 00:15:26.375
What powerful hatred.

00:15:33.417 --> 00:15:35.042
It's okay, he's alive.

00:15:35.042 --> 00:15:39.125
This woman is okay too.
It seems like she's asleep.

00:15:39.125 --> 00:15:41.583
I sure don't like the looks of this scene.

00:15:41.583 --> 00:15:43.375
Is he in there?

00:15:45.458 --> 00:15:46.792
What's that?

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.750
Someone else is interfering.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:00.625
I'm leaving this to you, Tiny.

00:16:00.625 --> 00:16:04.500
It appears they have
found out where his body is.

00:16:06.625 --> 00:16:09.750
Welcome to my dream world.

00:16:17.167 --> 00:16:18.625
Aoi!

00:16:19.708 --> 00:16:20.833
Let go!

00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:23.667
Aoi! Aoi!

00:16:23.667 --> 00:16:27.042
Sorry, but Aoi is mine.

00:16:27.042 --> 00:16:29.208
I won't hand her over to anyone.

00:16:29.208 --> 00:16:30.792
Why you...

00:16:30.792 --> 00:16:32.875
Misato doesn't belong to anyone.

00:16:32.875 --> 00:16:36.042
So, get your hands off her right now, you dolt!

00:16:37.625 --> 00:16:40.833
You still don't understand
the situation you're in, do you?

00:16:40.833 --> 00:16:44.542
Dying in this world means
dying in the real world too,

00:16:44.542 --> 00:16:47.083
and the four of you will soon be dead.

00:16:50.958 --> 00:16:52.750
Wh-What the hell?

00:17:02.083 --> 00:17:04.583
Oinshichiri kyararo hauunken sowaka.

00:17:04.583 --> 00:17:05.958
Oinshichiri kyara...

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:07.583
Misato!

00:17:14.208 --> 00:17:19.583
Let me tell you about journalists:
We'll risk our lives anytime.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:24.375
I'll never give Misato over to you!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.792
Daigo, Sakurai, you guys okay?

00:17:32.792 --> 00:17:34.875
Yeah! We're all right!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.375
Guys, this is a dream!

00:17:44.375 --> 00:17:46.667
Focus your minds!

00:17:49.833 --> 00:17:53.333
N-No way! This is my dream!

00:17:53.333 --> 00:17:57.833
Unfortunately for you,
we've got pretty strong wills.

00:17:57.833 --> 00:18:00.417
We're not losing to this.

00:18:02.292 --> 00:18:04.042
Takamizawa!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:17.125
Please stop this!

00:18:29.667 --> 00:18:32.458
You were sad, weren't you?

00:18:32.458 --> 00:18:34.625
It was painful, wasn't it?

00:19:00.833 --> 00:19:03.625
Furube, yurayura...

00:19:12.167 --> 00:19:14.625
You're free now.

00:19:14.625 --> 00:19:18.083
You must not let that hatred
stay inside you forever.

00:19:18.083 --> 00:19:20.792
Understand? Now return to how you were.

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:24.250
Save the people who are dear to you.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:29.458
Release this departed soul, begone now.

00:19:29.458 --> 00:19:34.125
Release this departed soul, begone now...

00:19:51.958 --> 00:19:54.917
This will never be over as long as
they keep regenerating like this!

00:19:54.917 --> 00:19:56.208
Yeah...

00:20:01.375 --> 00:20:02.583
Tatsuma!

00:20:13.458 --> 00:20:14.625
--Hiyuu!
--Hiyuu!

00:20:26.333 --> 00:20:28.625
Tatsuma! Go!

00:20:28.625 --> 00:20:30.292
Kyouichi...

00:20:40.375 --> 00:20:42.167
Tiny?

00:20:42.167 --> 00:20:45.542
Why did you come back? What about Aoi?

00:20:45.542 --> 00:20:48.583
Why didn't you bring back Aoi?!

00:21:01.083 --> 00:21:04.708
Stop this, Sagaya.

00:21:04.708 --> 00:21:09.583
Doing this won't save you or Tiny.

00:21:09.583 --> 00:21:11.583
Aoi!

00:21:11.583 --> 00:21:15.750
This isn't really what you want.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.875
You should know better than anyone.

00:21:20.458 --> 00:21:26.292
I don't want anyone dear to me to
go through such sorrow ever again!

00:21:26.292 --> 00:21:28.958
I won't ever forgive people who
harm others just for amusement,

00:21:28.958 --> 00:21:34.125
or who would take the life
of an innocent, little creature.

00:21:34.125 --> 00:21:38.167
So, you have courage too!
Cast aside your hatred!

00:21:38.167 --> 00:21:40.708
Have more regard for yourself.

00:21:43.792 --> 00:21:45.125
No...

00:21:45.125 --> 00:21:49.167
I... I don't care what happens to me!

00:21:49.167 --> 00:21:54.875
But I at least... I wanted to
protect Tiny at the very least!

00:21:56.125 --> 00:22:00.417
Tiny! I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:22:00.417 --> 00:22:03.208
I'm sorry!

00:22:03.208 --> 00:22:08.542
I wanted to be strong enough
to protect the ones I care for.

00:22:08.542 --> 00:22:11.667
I wanted to be strong!

00:22:11.667 --> 00:22:15.000
You can change, I know you can.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:19.167
Use this power to protect people instead.

00:22:24.667 --> 00:22:26.292
Wh-What's going on?

00:22:28.792 --> 00:22:31.208
The dream world is falling apart.

00:22:33.542 --> 00:22:37.250
Thank you, Aoi.

00:22:41.917 --> 00:22:47.667
All of the high school students who had
inexplicably fallen comatose five days ago

00:22:47.667 --> 00:22:49.542
have recovered as of earlier this morning.

00:22:49.958 --> 00:22:51.583
--They all seem to be doing just fine.
--At present,

00:22:51.583 --> 00:22:53.458
--They all seem to be doing just fine.
--none are exhibiting any residual effects or complications...

00:22:53.458 --> 00:22:56.958
We'll take care of him here for a bit.

00:22:56.958 --> 00:22:58.792
Lookin' all peaceful and shit...

00:22:58.792 --> 00:23:01.833
But I'm sure his soul is saved now.

00:23:01.833 --> 00:23:03.167
Yeah...

00:23:07.125 --> 00:23:08.833
Misato!

00:23:09.958 --> 00:23:11.917
Oh, thank goodness!

00:23:25.625 --> 00:23:27.417
The dream master...

00:23:27.417 --> 00:23:31.875
Cripes, none of these people are any use!

00:23:31.875 --> 00:23:36.000
Well, I guess this is my next order of business.

00:23:37.333 --> 00:23:39.958
It is them as I thought.

00:23:49.333 --> 00:23:52.125
This concludes our business for today.

00:23:52.125 --> 00:23:53.458
See you around.

